id="m-67a6e0a5-7add-4e64-a639-5ba30f06935b" facs="#m-41742964-2eb7-423a-962b-a0a085f1b007" label="ambiguous">V. Tu,</l><l xml:id="m-db75501f-a631-4f22-9bef-4e7fc01a19a2" facs="#m-12431e89-d201-4f08-ab21-7803a9d892ee" label="ambiguous">iij</l><l xml:id="m-2df5dd4f-0c47-4828-a94c-fd896cfc147b" facs="#m-22902285-7ca7-4994-8041-370283258215" label="lyrics-like">pú¬</l><l xml:id="m-ce7fae61-1a50-41ba-bf9b-538259982389" facs="#m-8e05ebce-f75d-4262-9419-718d89a0f32c" label="lyrics-like">ta Altís¬</l><l xml:id="m-a78842d8-844e-4f20-8e6c-9b7a8fc0baca" facs="#m-bb8024cc-a53c-49b9-9269-46c416596bb9" label="lyrics-like">prophé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1b2b891-fae6-46fb-9e01-53f532b07e80" facs="#m-dc2476db-e799-4414-83d8-163e999d7697" label="ambiguous">er,</l><l xml:id="m-7d11f8cd-04e0-4fc9-97dc-deddf273435e" facs="#m-62970ec2-3c0e-4414-a6d0-7fff62253972" label="ambiguous">bis</l><l xml:id="m-18409b25-088b-4979-a641-a54f9f5f86b0" facs="#m-d0b4808f-cef8-4a78-98c0-30f3a8d3599f" label="lyrics-like">ante Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-8267fd01-c44b-4bcf-bf98-879e2faf7562" facs="#m-33a08987-c1e3-4107-9152-6532e5e0069d" label="lyrics-like">simi vo¬ cábe-ris: prae-i¬</l><l xml:id="m-dbb1c3f8-2b99-43b8-a722-9ebdedb4782a" facs="#m-a51ff9ce-88fc-4186-aefe-454bef3ebdac" label="lyrics-like">minum pa-rá-re ví-as * é¬ jus.</l><l xml:id="m-b48e9cfa-416b-4a20-8f54-031496ba8c62" facs="#m-a9ccf175-4373-4ff6-ab0e-51197f5773a2" label="ambiguous">* Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Lucam. Luc. 1.f.</l><l xml:id="m-7366a1b9-4240-4a72-86ef-b8944a600ff8" facs="#m-78b6a17f-de6d-4f6b-9c22-aeba0bf9e988" label="lyrics-like">"Lisabeth implétum est tempus! nomen ejus. Et miráti sunt univérsi.</l><l xml:id="m-e7b414e3-ca3b-4f60-b1fc-ffbb4feb2b48" facs="#m-c4a4f2cb-7fd6-4263-b822-d957913b7af7" label="lyrics-like">C pariéndi, et péperit filium. Et</l><l xml:id="m-bab689c4-708a-4340-aa43-fa098b45c36e" facs="#m-b90da6a1-8cac-4977-a809-487bdb7b8fc8" label="lyrics-like">Apértum est autem illico os ejus et</l><l xml:id="m-df216f9c-12fd-48fe-a473-4db74a826f73" facs="#m-d7706686-ffe7-4fd5-8279-0279ad22c524" label="lyrics-like">lingua ejus, et loquebátur benedi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5f476329-f6df-4a0a-8fd7-ca2638617998" facs="#m-631de67c-1ab5-4eb3-b1ff-3a41ac1b220b" label="lyrics-like">audiérunt vicini et cognáti ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-a5f13454-0f89-4cfb-893b-61c10178a329" facs="#m-67141d0d-b473-4c0d-92c8-d2cbf9ba0eb4" label="lyrics-like">quia magnificávit Dóminus miseri¬</l><l xml:id="m-a123bbcf-cd57-443a-9dbc-109254757a90" facs="#m-7807fa27-6183-4a28-926f-aca55bab1a92" label="ambiguous">cens Deum. Et factus est timor su¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b9482c7-ef20-4046-823e-fc8891867392" facs="#m-f89c750e-0719-4d14-990c-ee769de850b7" label="lyrics-like">per omnes vicinos eórum: et super</l><l xml:id="m-ff3b1b8c-6fd6-48a3-a3fb-898d7b557016" facs="#m-920b7813-5846-4b53-a92f-4d3e89e6c854" label="lyrics-like">córdiam suam cum illa, et congra¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a8093b9-1f00-4b7e-b858-80bfc0232d09" facs="#m-6ea65ced-6ef0-465e-b884-f42dee6ff6e3" label="lyrics-like">ómnia montána Judaéae divulga¬</l><l xml:id="m-965baa98-abb5-49f0-b6b0-14d32dd47647" facs="#m-61cb4be7-f8da-4000-b9e5-648b26e779ab" label="lyrics-like">tulabántur ei. Et factum est in die</l><l xml:id="m-6dadd9e0-8de8-4ea9-b2d5-7affd7bffbd9" facs="#m-52a66b95-b679-48d5-990a-c3a3395fe18b" label="lyrics-like">bántur ómnia verba haec: et posué¬</l><l xml:id="m-e633f4ee-3834-43c9-bcda-7e3b11392251" facs="#m-ee99292d-c3d6-4df0-b21b-02cc9594f8cb" label="lyrics-like">octávo, venérunt circumcidere púe¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a597f9c-05b0-4ecc-aebb-60dc0fcce004" facs="#m-a2ff6647-f629-415f-87fe-055d1a14c75a" label="lyrics-like">runt omnes, qui audíerant, in corde</l><l xml:id="m-10d36fdb-7a2a-4f14-819a-91aaa99ab605" facs="#m-58c05f77-71a9-4a63-88fe-5be45e409240" label="lyrics-like">rum, et vocábant eum nóminé pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-c97af9ac-5b6e-47af-90ba-f530633d6570" facs="#m-c2d04835-6c95-4bc0-afc9-4ddb79811d54" label="lyrics-like">suo, dicéntes : Quis, putas, puer iste</l><l xml:id="m-91bfb9c2-66c4-4955-83c1-d8aa1f82895d" facs="#m-f794dd75-ecf7-4374-9ef4-b4aba4a85910" label="lyrics-like">tris sui Zacharíam. Et respóndens</l><l xml:id="m-d1704ced-4138-4393-b5f2-cd67e9021391" facs="#m-18e39653-f429-41a4-95d7-c8174beee289" label="lyrics-like">erit? Etenim manus Dómini erat</l><l xml:id="m-4e2501b5-6ca0-4254-81cc-9727590f5e24" facs="#m-b209cfc4-aa51-4ec1-a0a0-feed6ccc3fba" label="lyrics-like">mater ejus, dixit : Nequáquam, sed</l><l xml:id="m-e1a0df7f-bee5-4545-b2fe-b38a0f007fbf" facs="#m-27ad664d-d4e7-4043-b6c8-893914d7ff59" label="lyrics-like">cum illo. Et Zacharías, pater ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-61eecd0f-006a-4725-a76a-9b4cca320aa9" facs="#m-65801878-a368-4fdb-b123-db26b6112ee7" label="lyrics-like">vocábitur Joánnes. Et dixérunt ad</l><l xml:id="m-871649ab-1502-4aff-a576-5925018830ca" facs="#m-ab8d0dc1-85b4-4dee-9d52-fff234fbfd71" label="lyrics-like">replétus est Spiritu Sancto, et pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-b1888d7d-7232-4fbc-87e1-4693e22f9eea" facs="#m-0841dc8a-141f-4c3b-aa46-54807c45a3c5" label="lyrics-like">illam: Quiã nemo est in cognatióne</l><l xml:id="m-d59e06a7-3dac-42d8-970d-a70c0164eddb" facs="#m-b8c36cb1-f9b7-44ac-83c5-83ecec460edb" label="lyrics-like">phetávit, dicens: Benedictus Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-9aa2a675-6c3d-44c2-87f9-cca28f86bff7" facs="#m-fafe0e03-84db-4865-96de-192a3e485f87" label="lyrics-like">tua, qui vocétur hoc nóminẽ. Innué¬</l><l xml:id="m-20f6548f-c693-4499-aea8-c00680dc27a9" facs="#m-2a87fe67-7b24-4c3d-8bcb-f8a3a7dcc381" label="lyrics-like">nus, Deus Israel, quia visitávit et</l><l xml:id="m-d03ff167-d704-4faf-a23a-6b7818af63c6" facs="#m-51873a8a-2282-4ed2-b502-ccf27925a158" label="ambiguous">bant autem patri ejus, quem vellet</l><l xml:id="m-c948b199-0237-4020-ab6f-530826a1f72f" facs="#m-7f1ef9b2-527c-4b1f-88c7-9839cf1e1e46" label="lyrics-like">vocári eum. Et póstulans pugillá- fecit redemptiónem plebis suae.</l><l xml:id="m-b32b5731-9de4-445e-ac55-bc201ec6ed24" facs="#m-65e027a6-febd-41f4-8860-1d5a9af5320d" label="lyrics-like">rem, scripsit, dicens: Joánnes est!</l><l xml:id="m-3a4d353c-bb09-4ba4-a86a-f894195038a9" facs="#m-6fc09064-8cbe-480d-823a-fb4f9aae4977" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Jústus ut pálma. p. 1193.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>